ta, Sean Chiplock, Brianna Knickerbocker, Aleks Le and more<br></li><li> A haunting original soundtrack composed by Alec Shea, with vocals performed by Emi Evans on the opening theme<br></li><li> Multiple endings<br></li><li> Unlockable image gallery</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VOICE CAST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Erika Harlacher as Noriko<br></li><li> Aleks Le as Kojiro<br></li><li> Brianna Knickerbocker as Aoi<br></li><li> Faye Mata as Tomoe<br></li><li> Sean Chiplock as Shinya<br></li><li> Kaiji Tang as Junpei<br></li><li> Anairis Qui\u00f1ones as Emi<br></li><li> Lizzie Freeman as Yuriko<br></li><li> June Yoon as Fujikawa<br></li><li> Aimee Smith as Kotomi<br></li><li> Alec Shea as Kenji</li></ul>",
